{"id": "EUVD-2026-77631", "enisaUuid": "55d68897-7c94-33ea-acd2-613f77bd01fd", "description": "A security flaw has been discovered in GNU Binutils 2.47. This impacts the function cache_bwrite of the file bfd/cache.c of the component ld. The manipulation of the argument nbytes results in buffer overflow. The attack requires a local approach. The exploit has been released to the public and may be used for attacks. The project was informed of the problem early through a bug report but has not responded yet.", "datePublished": "2026-09-14T16:15:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-14T16:32:57", "baseScore": 4.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P", "references": ["https://vuldb.com/vuln/403303", "https://vuldb.com/vuln/403303/cti", "https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-90801", "https://vuldb.com/submit/920276", "https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=34442", "https://github.com/r1ck9-2q/cve_summit/blob/main/Heap-buffer-overflow%20in%20%60cache_bwrite%60%20(bfdcache.c436)%20via%20malformed%20ELF%20with%20%60--gc-sections%20-w%60.md", "https://www.gnu.org/"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90801", "GHSA-x22q-2wh5-h6hv"], "assigner": "VulDB", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "44880dd4-0e80-38de-ac74-9cac3eea8a32", "product": {"name": "Binutils", "vendor": {"name": "GNU"}}, "product_version": "2.47"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b2cb7797-7981-37cd-b3cc-56219c4507e7", "vendor": {"name": "GNU"}}], "isExploited": false}